// Send destinations from staged points-to results. Include imports.dl and otp.dl, which
// provides staged_processes.dl, first.

// The send may reach proc through its direct target or a parameter supplied by a caller
// (process_call).
.decl send_target(id: symbol, func: symbol, message: symbol, proc: symbol)

send_target(id, f, m, p) :- process_send_source(id, f, m, _, _), call_site_target(id, f, "info", p).

// Behaviour envelopes use tag and tuple size: `$gen_call`, `$gen_cast`, and `system`
// are dispatched as calls, casts, or sys requests, not info messages. Check each send's
// `send_envelope`; tag alone would misclassify ordinary messages such as `{:system,
// :reload}`.
